{"id":"26eb678054493880","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-vl-basic.md","title":"van Lambalgen归约的随机性与Turing性质","display":"thm-vl-basic — van Lambalgen归约的随机性与Turing性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-vl-basic","aliases":["43-thm-vl-basic"],"display":"thm-vl-basic — van Lambalgen归约的随机性与Turing性质","depends_on":["[[43-df-vl-red]]","[[43-df-nrandom]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Theorem 14.4.4(i),(ii),(iv); printed pp.396–397 / PDF pp.416–417","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-vl-basic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-vl-basic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-vl-basic — van Lambalgen归约的随机性与Turing性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6812f594e37d97c\" href=\"?note=d6812f594e37d97c\" title=\"43-df-vl-red\">43-df-vl-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 14.4.4(i),(ii),(iv); printed pp.396–397 / PDF pp.416–417"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d6812f594e37d97c\" href=\"?note=d6812f594e37d97c\" title=\"43-df-vl-red\">43-df-vl-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\land\\mathrm{Random}_n(X))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Random}_n(Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\land\\mathrm{Random}_n(X))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Random}_n(Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall Y\\in2^\\omega\\;X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall Y\\in2^\\omega\\;X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(Y\\le_TX\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(Y))\\Rightarrow X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(Y\\le_TX\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(Y))\\Rightarrow X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一项由与跳跃同Turing度的随机辅助序列及van Lambalgen定理得到；第三项的Turing方向反转只在Y随机的前提下成立。第二项明确非随机序列组成整个最小vL度。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 14.4.4(i),(ii),(iv); printed pp.396–397 / PDF pp.416–417。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-vl-red","status":"resolved","id":"d6812f594e37d97c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-vl-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"targ